WEBVTT

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.240
Ai Ohto...

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.870
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.490
Walking.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:27.870
This late at night?

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.290
Oh... a dream?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.120
You don't like dreams?

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.490
Would you prefer reality?

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.240
The first time's free.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.540
After that, bring your wallet.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.490
How much?

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:47.450
Don't worry. I know you'll like it.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.700
It's a special capsule machine, after all.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.160
Special how?

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.450
It has the thing you want in it.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:58.660
I don't really want anything.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.540
Don't lie. Of course you do.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.950
A friend.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:23.410
Episode 1 'The Domain of Children'

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.580
It wasn't a dream.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:53.160
I wonder if I should keep it cold.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:57.080
But if it's alive, maybe I should warm it up.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:01.080
It's hard.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.370
Oh, it might end up as a boiled egg.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:11.540
Can I crack it?

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.200
Actually, <i>should</i> I crack it?

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.740
I'll drop off my bag. You go on ahead.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:24.620
The usual place?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.700
Yeah.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.580
Ai! Your teacher is here.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:35.560
Ai's Room

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:33.290
There's no need to force her to get up, ma'am.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:36.080
I just brought this week's printouts.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.740
I'm so sorry.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.370
You're always so kind.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:40.990
Oh no, it's nothing.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.950
I'm just stopping by to
check on her on my way home.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.910
I wonder what's in it.

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:49.200
I'll try going back there tomorrow.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.580
I'm going out.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.700
Huh?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.490
This is...

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.490
What am I doing at school?

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.120
You're overdoing it.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.370
Any less and she won't get the message.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:42.790
In that case, I'll add a bunch more.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.790
Die

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:46.580
Whoa, brutal! Who's overdoing it now?

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.200
All of you at school today, a question:

00:04:55.200 --> 00:05:00.200
What should you do if someone
in your class is being bullied?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:04.700
You got it! The right answer is:
Pretend not to see!

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.870
Ai Ohto.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.620
Break the Egg.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.580
The what?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.830
The Wonder Egg.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.700
You mean this?

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.830
Quickly, break it.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.790
But it's so hard, I can't crack it.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.580
Break it now!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:49.160
Break it!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.620
Shut up!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.370
You're good at this.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.120
Damn it. Why'd you break it
in a place like this?

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.240
If you're done, leave.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.410
Okay.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.490
Did she have to put it like that?

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.580
I hate her attitude.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.910
Just ask normally.

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.240
I said yes, though.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.330
Stand up!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.330
Okay!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.200
Let's run!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.370
Huh?

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.740
What's that?

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.990
Oh, um, uh...

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.990
We need to run.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.490
What are they?!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:47.830
You ought to know!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.370
They're Seeno Evils!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:54.700
What's that?!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:55.990
No idea!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.080
Stand up!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.160
This way!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.580
Wait up!

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.160
Is this where my liver is?

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.910
Am I going to be okay?!

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.200
Let's go!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.540
Huh?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.450
Hurry up!

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.580
It's a dream. A bad dream.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.950
Show me your cut.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:03.790
Huh?

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.160
Hurry.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.370
It's gone.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.580
Mine don't disappear.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.450
This is a dream to you,

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.910
but to me, it's reality.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.200
Anyway, we'll keep running until the bell rings.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.410
There's nothing to be scared of.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:28.290
They only come after me.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.200
Plus, you're immortal in this world.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:34.120
As long as your eyes and heart are okay.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.540
Does that really count as immortal?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.740
Well, I guess not.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:40.990
Oh, why is this happening to me?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.790
Because you bought the Egg.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:43.870
I didn't buy it.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.120
They said the first one is free.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:50.290
Yeah. Nothing costs more than a free gift, huh?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.540
It's not funny.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.240
So, you've got no friends.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:56.950
I don't not have them; I don't need them.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.450
No way.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.910
It's true.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:03.200
You wouldn't have broken the Egg if it were.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.490
It's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.620
I didn't have any either.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.450
No way.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.580
It's the truth.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.120
I guess I did have superficial ones.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:18.540
Friends who would chime in,
"Totally! Oh, I know! Adorable!"

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:23.290
But I didn't have a best friend.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.620
Thinking back on it, best friends matter a lot.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:30.830
You break up with boyfriends,
but best friends are forever, right?

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.830
I guess so.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.490
You had a boyfriend?

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:36.620
Did you?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.950
I asked first.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.490
Okay, how about we answer on "go"?

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.830
Sure.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.540
Ready, go.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:49.990
No fair!

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.490
Same to you.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.160
Huh?

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.330
Hm?

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.700
Let's go.

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.790
Sorry.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:16.160
Why apologize?

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.330
It's their fault.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.740
I'm sorry!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.240
It's true. They don't attack me.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:35.200
They don't... attack me.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:52.580
Hm?

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:37.660
Koito?

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.790
I'm Koito Nagase.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.240
Please be friends with me, everyone.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:55.990
All right, Nagase, take the seat next to Ohto.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.040
Okay.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.660
Let's walk home together.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.870
Huh?

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:26.120
What do you mean, "Huh"?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.240
That hurts.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.370
It's nice and quiet here, huh?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.990
What's that?

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.490
A game.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:40.790
Do you like games?

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.080
Kind of.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.910
Hmm.

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.490
What game?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.620
Ohto?

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.080
U-Umm,

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.700
I don't think you should hang out with me.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.160
Why not?

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.410
B-Because I'm ugly!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.580
What?

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.870
You're not even a little ugly.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:09.330
You've got big, round eyes.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.040
Your haircut?

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.240
Why do you hide this one?

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.040
Where's your umbrella?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.410
I forgot it.

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.740
And your bag?

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:29.830
Ai?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.290
I forgot it.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.540
Is something wrong?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.290
It's nothing!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:50.410
Ai, a friend is here to see you.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.240
She's not my friend. I don't have friends.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:09.490
You forgot these. I came to return them.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:11.450
Thanks.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:23.870
That's called heterochromia, right?
When your irises are different colors.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.870
It's common in cats and dogs.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.790
It's mysterious.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.790
You shouldn't hide it.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.700
I get bullied for it.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.160
Always.

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.790
It's pretty.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.540
Be my friend.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.200
Let's be best friends.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.540
No?

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.660
I... do want to, but...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.580
But?

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.540
If we could, I'd be happy.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.370
Me, too.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.330
It's my fault.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:39.160
Because I betrayed you.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.160
Even though you were
the first friend I ever made.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:54.910
Koito.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:25.290
But... But I almost made it
until the bell rang!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.990
I'm sick of this.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.450
Stay away!

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:54.450
Crosswalks are still scary
even when you move with the crowd.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.540
I'm done pretending not to see!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:33.620
Now I'm mad!

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:58.330
I'm Kurumi Saijo.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.790
Ai Ohto.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.910
Ai... I guess this is goodbye.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.990
Huh?

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.830
Don't forget me.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:12.910
Too bad.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.540
Only you get saved.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.410
But you have to cheer up.

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:20.290
If you want your best friend back.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.790
Huh?

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.080
She's a little warm.

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:30.450
Because I protected Kurumi?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:35.790
Hey, if I protect a bunch more people,
will Koito come back to life?

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.370
She will, right?!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.740
Ai! Breakfast is ready!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.160
Thank you.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.290
The weather is lovely today,

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.830
so don't spend it all in bed.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:59.200
I hung up the laundry to dry,
so take it in this afternoon.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.260
Oh, would you look at the time.

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:02.450
Oh. I'm immortal there, but...

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:07.160
I have a meeting this morning,
so I've got to go now.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.330
Lunch is...

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.580
What on earth...?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.700
I don't know. I have no idea.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.490
Maybe she snuck out last night and...

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.990
Please, stay strong.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.830
Koito...

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.790
Hi there. How are your injuries?

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.200
I'll manage.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.540
And your wallet?

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.450
I brought it.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.990
How many rescues to bring Koito back?

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.040
That, I can't say.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:57.490
If I protect more at once,
will it go that much faster?

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.700
You're a greedy idiot, huh?

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.240
If you can't protect them,
you won't make it either.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.870
Koito!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.410
Besides, your enemies won't always be so easy.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.620
They're just Seeno Evils.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.450
A disorderly mob.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:18.540
Whoa!

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.790
What happened to Kurumi?

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:31.790
She's just like your best friend.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.330
She's a sculpture in some world.

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:38.910
And unless her friends go to that world,
she'll stay that way forever.

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.290
Did Kurumi kill herself, too?

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:43.080
No comment.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.700
♪ No comment. ♪

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.370
Welcome.

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.120
Nice to meet you. I'm Acca.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:14.120
The one to your left is Ura-Acca.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:15.410
Hey.

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:16.240
H-Hey.

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:19.370
There's someone ahead of you. Wait a moment.

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:20.790
Okay.

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:26.080
Wait, I'm not the only one?

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:38.240
That girl...

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:39.660
Wow.

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:41.830
Yes, we're always worried about her.

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:43.740
She's got an amazing figure!

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:45.040
Oh, that.

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:01.940
Next time

00:22:58.370 --> 00:22:59.660
To be continued.
